      "mergedPostDetails": "EN\n\nThere is no problem immediately after joining the instance, but after a while, I noticed that the position of my avatar, mainly the height, was off when seen by the other person. I noticed something strange from the direction the other person's face was facing, so I put my fingers together like in the movie ET. It gets fixed when I rejoin, but it happens again soon, so I hope they fix it. This bug has been occurring since the update that changed the world line just the other day.\n\nJP\n\nインスタンスにjoinした直後は問題ないが、しばらくすると相手から見えてる自分のアバターの位置、主に高さがズレてることに気がついた。相手の顔が向いてる方向から違和感を持ち映画のETの様に指を合わせて気がついた。rejoinすると直るがすぐに再発するので直して欲しい。このバグは、ついこの前の世界線が変わるアップデートから発生している。",
      "mergedPostTitle": "After updating, the position of your avatar as seen by others becomes misaligned",
